WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.295
The prince wanted to free Rapunzel.

2
00:00:05.296 --> 00:00:09.202
But she shook her head. "I cannot leave.

3
00:00:09.203 --> 00:00:14.831
The witch will hurt my parents."

4
00:00:14.832 --> 00:00:18.628
"Then what will you do?" the prince asked.

5
00:00:18.629 --> 00:00:22.010
"You cannot stay here forever."

6
00:00:22.011 --> 00:00:26.183
"Very soon I will be 18," Rapunzel said.

7
00:00:26.184 --> 00:00:29.346
"The witch promised to let me go then."

8
00:00:29.347 --> 00:00:35.130
The prince sighed. "May I visit you again?"

9
00:00:35.131 --> 00:00:41.348
Rapunzel smiled. "Of course!"

10
00:00:41.349 --> 00:00:45.198
In the morning the witch returned.

11
00:00:45.199 --> 00:00:49.275
"Rapunzel, Rapunzel!" she called.

12
00:00:49.276 --> 00:00:52.837
"Let down your hair!"

13
00:00:52.838 --> 00:01:03.224
Rapunzel dropped down her hair.

14
00:01:03.225 --> 00:01:07.820
And in the evening, the prince returned.

15
00:01:07.821 --> 00:01:16.600
"Rapunzel, Rapunzel, let down your hair!"

16
00:01:16.601 --> 00:01:24.981
He climbed up.

17
00:01:24.982 --> 00:01:31.879
"I brought you some books!" he said.

18
00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:39.147
Rapunzel and the prince talked a lot.

19
00:01:39.148 --> 00:01:44.966
They sang together.

20
00:01:44.967 --> 00:01:50.385
"You are a beautiful singer!" the prince said.

21
00:01:50.386 --> 00:01:57.646
He turned red. "I mean, your songs are beautiful!"

22
00:01:57.647 --> 00:02:11.816
Then he smiled shyly. "But you are beautiful too!"

23
00:02:11.817 --> 00:02:15.373
"The prince is kind," Rapunzel thought.

24
00:02:15.374 --> 00:02:21.961
"He is smart and handsome too."

25
00:02:21.962 --> 00:02:25.986
The next morning the witch arrived.

26
00:02:25.987 --> 00:02:40.620
"Rapunzel, Rapunzel, let down your hair!"

27
00:02:40.621 --> 00:02:45.769
The witch looked around the tower and frowned.

28
00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:48.858
"Where is the hair potion?

29
00:02:48.859 --> 00:02:51.694
And the baby-sleeping potion?

30
00:02:51.695 --> 00:02:57.290
What did you do yesterday?"

31
00:02:57.291 --> 00:03:02.504
Rapunzel smiled dreamily. "Nothing much".

32
00:03:02.505 --> 00:03:05.915
I will mix the potions now."

33
00:03:05.916 --> 00:03:11.186
She started to chop herbs.

34
00:03:11.187 --> 00:03:17.596
But Rapunzel made lots of mistakes.

35
00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:21.768
"What's wrong with her?" the witch thought.

36
00:03:21.769 --> 00:03:25.741
She gazed around and saw something.

37
00:03:25.742 --> 00:03:31.839
It was a lump under Rapunzel's mattress.

38
00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:36.915
The witch lifted the mattress.

39
00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:41.707
"Where did these books come from?" the witch snapped.

40
00:03:41.708 --> 00:03:46.674
"I . . . I had them in my pockets," Rapunzel said.

41
00:03:46.675 --> 00:03:49.674
"When you first put me here."

42
00:03:49.675 --> 00:03:58.978
The witch muttered something under her breath.

43
00:03:58.979 --> 00:04:09.762
That night the prince visited again.

44
00:04:09.763 --> 00:04:16.056
Soon a voice growled, "Rapunzel, Rapunzel!

45
00:04:16.057 --> 00:04:19.717
Let down your hair right now!"

